<section class="content">
  <div class="wrap">
    <section>
      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>This site sets no cookies of its own and runs no analytics, trackers, or third-party scripts. There is nothing here that follows you across sessions or across other sites.</p>
      <p>The site is hosted on Cloudflare's network. Like any web host, Cloudflare's infrastructure keeps standard server-level logs (IP address, request time, browser user-agent) for security and abuse prevention — this is infrastructure logging, not something this site configures, reads, or uses for tracking. It applies the same way it would to any static website.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Rights over the book</h2>
      <p>The text and illustrations of <em>Thinking in Products, Building Systems</em>, published chapter by chapter on this site, are © José Ángel Sosa López. All rights reserved.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>You're welcome to read, link to, and quote short excerpts with attribution.</li>
        <li>Reproducing, redistributing, or republishing full chapters elsewhere — including the downloadable PDF edition — requires prior written permission.</li>
        <li>The downloadable PDF is provided for personal reading, not for redistribution.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>For anything about this policy, or to request permission to reuse the book's content, <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a>.</p>
    </section>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: 12 Sep 2026.</p>
  </div>
